{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09200","headline":"答韩库部 · 韦应物","name":"答韩库部","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良玉表贞度，丽藻颇爲工。\n名列金闺籍，心与素士同。\n日晏下朝来，车马自生风。\n清宵有佳兴，皓月直南宫。\n矫翮方上征，顾我邈忡忡。\n岂不愿攀举，执事府庭中。\n智乖时亦蹇，才大命有通。\n还当以道推，解组守蒿蓬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09200.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09200","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}